<title>EGYPT: Delta Insurance yr-end profit up.</title>
<headline>Delta Insurance yr-end profit up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Insurance said on Monday it made net profits of 5.865 million pounds ($1.73 million) in calendar 1996, 6.9 percent up on 5.486 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's total assets at the end of the year stood at 279.256 million pounds, compared with 255.223 million a year earlier, it said in an announcement.</p>
<p>The little-traded shares closed on the Cairo stock exchange on Sunday at 30.00 pounds a share. They did not trade on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
